;
Distal domain of K63-linked diubiquitin. 
The K63R mutation is made to prevent formation of polyubiquitin during enzymatic
linkage to the proximal domain. 
Joined to the proximal domain of diubiquitin at residue G76 using an isopeptide bond.
;
