;
Proximal domain of K63-linked diubiquitin. 
The additional aspartic acid on the C-terminus (+D77) is made to prevent
formation of polyubiquitin during enzymatic linkage to the distal domain. 
Joined to the distal domain of diubiquitin at residue K63 using 
an isopeptide bond.
;
